{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 54634, "name": "Ben Cotton", "username": "bcotton", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/bcotton/{size}/28189_2.png", "created_at": "2021-10-29T12:00:18.053Z", "cooked": "<p><small>Originally published at:\t\t\t<a href=\"https://communityblog.fedoraproject.org/fridays-fedora-facts-2021-43/\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Friday's Fedora Facts: 2021-43 – Fedora Community Blog</a><br>\n</small><br></p><p>Here’s your weekly Fedora report. Read what happened this week and what’s coming up. Your contributions are welcome (see the end of the post)!</p><p></p>\n<p>Fedora Linux 35 will be released on Tuesday! Fedora Linux 33 will reach end of life on Tuesday 30 November.</p>\n<p>I have weekly office hours on Wednesdays in the morning and afternoon (US/Eastern time) in #fedora-meeting-1. Drop by if you have any questions or comments about the schedule, Changes, elections, or anything else. See the <a href=\"#upcoming-meetings\">upcoming meetings</a> for more information.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#announcements\">Announcements</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#cfps\">Calls for Participation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#help-wanted\">Help wanted</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#upcoming-meetings\">Upcoming meetings</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#releases\">Releases</a></li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h2>Announcements</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/reminder-summer-time-changes-coming-up/27831/2\">Summer time is changing</a> in various locations.</li>\n<li>Registration is open for the <a href=\"https://hopin.com/events/fedora-linux-35-release-party/registration\">F35 Release Party</a>.</li>\n<li>Fedora Linux 33 reaches end of life on Tuesday 30 November.</li>\n<li>The Taiga instance on teams.fedoraproject.org will be <a href=\"https://communityblog.fedoraproject.org/retiring-taiga-instance-on-teams-fedoraproject-org/\">retired on 17 December</a>.</li>\n</ul><h3>CfPs</h3>\n<table>\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Conference</th>\n<th>Location</th>\n<th>Date</th>\n<th>CfP</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.devconf.info/cz/\">DevConf.CZ</a></td>\n<td>Brno, CZ &amp; virtual</td>\n<td>28–29 Jan</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://cfp.devconf.info/\">closes 31 Oct</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.socallinuxexpo.org/scale/19x\">SCaLE</a></td>\n<td>Pasadena, CA, US</td>\n<td>5–8 Mar</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.socallinuxexpo.org/scale/19x/cfp\">closes 30 Nov</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2>Help wanted</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>315 <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/PackageReviewStatus/\">package review requests</a> are awaiting a reviewer</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/VHQN5VB2R3B7IKLM7QEII27YACAVNDJN/\">Orphaned packages</a> seeking maintainers</li>\n</ul><h2>Prioritized Bugs</h2>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/program_management/prioritized_bugs/\">Prioritized Bugs documentation</a> for information on the process, including how to nominate bugs.</p>\n<h2>Upcoming meetings</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Blocker review meeting — <a href=\"https://calendar.fedoraproject.org/meeting/10066\">1600 UTC Monday</a> in #fedora-blocker-review</li>\n<li>FPgM Office Hours — <a href=\"https://calendar.fedoraproject.org/meeting/9527/\">1300 UTC Wednesday</a> and <a href=\"https://calendar.fedoraproject.org/meeting/9915/\">2000 UTC Wednesday</a> in #fedora-meeting-1</li>\n<li>Prioritized bugs meeting — <a href=\"https://calendar.fedoraproject.org/meeting/9964/\">1500 UTC Wednesday</a> in #fedora-meeting-1 </li>\n<li>Fedora Social Hour — <a href=\"https://calendar.fedoraproject.org/meeting/9743/\">1400 UTC Thursday</a> in <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/#social:fedoraproject.org?web-instance%5Belement.io%5D=chat.fedoraproject.org\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">#social on Fedora.im</a> </li>\n</ul><h2>Releases</h2>\n<table>\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Release</th>\n<th>open bugs</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>F33</td>\n<td>5118</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F34</td>\n<td>5354</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F35 (beta)</td>\n<td>1286</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F36 (rawhide)</td>\n<td>6421</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h3>Fedora Linux 35</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>187 packages <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?bug_status=__open__&amp;f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=1927309\">fail to build from source</a>\n</li>\n<li>52 packages <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?bug_status=__open__&amp;f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=1927313\">fail to install</a>\n</li>\n</ul><h4>Schedule</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>2021-11-02</strong> — Final target date #2</li>\n</ul><p>For the full schedule, see the <a href=\"https://fedorapeople.org/groups/schedule/f-35/f-35-key-tasks.html\">schedule website</a>.</p>\n<h4>Changes</h4>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Releases/35/ChangeSet\">ChangeSet page</a> or <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=F35Changes\">Bugzilla</a> for information on approved Changes.</p>\n<table>\n<thead><tr>\n<th>BZ Status</th>\n<th>Count</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>ASSIGNED</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MODIFIED</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ON_QA</td>\n<td>41</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h3>Fedora Linux 36</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>248 packages <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?bug_status=__open__&amp;f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=1992484\">fail to build from source</a>\n</li>\n<li>58 packages <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?bug_status=__open__&amp;f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=1992487\">fail to install</a>\n</li>\n</ul><h4>Changes</h4>\n<p>The table below lists proposed Changes. See the <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Releases/36/ChangeSet\">ChangeSet page</a> or <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=F36Changes\">Bugzilla</a> for information on approved Changes.</p>\n<table>\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Proposal</th>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th>Status</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/RetiredPackages\">Retired Packages</a></td>\n<td>Self-Contained</td>\n<td>Approved</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Make_Authselect_Mandatory\">Enforce Authselect Configuration Consistency</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://pagure.io/fesco/issue/2680\">FESCo #2680</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Ansible5\">Ansible 5</a></td>\n<td>Self-Contained</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://pagure.io/fesco/issue/2681\">FESCo #2681</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Openldap_25\">OpenLDAP 2.5</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://pagure.io/fesco/issue/2682\">FESCo #2682</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/drop_NIS_support_from_PAM\">Drop NIS(+) support from PAM</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/JTNY5UW4JQ3BVYYOLGFJXLL36BU7ES26/\">Announced</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/retire_NIS_user_space_utils\">Retire the NIS(+) user-space utility programs</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/AQDEJYGUBXO2NY6P4I525C4RIVPJ2NIT/\">Announced</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Package_information_on_ELF_objects\">Package information on ELF objects</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devele@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/GX4X6Z7VTP5P5ZOFFESC3FJ4EOYR2TOU/\">Announced</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/ReplaceFbdevDrivers\">Replace the fbdev drivers with simpledrm and the DRM fbdev emulation layer</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/XBYN7WX3L6QQHGCO6N6KCMAQLUXJMIJX/\">Announced</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/rubygem-cucumber_7.1.0\">Rubygem Cucumber 7.1.0</a></td>\n<td>Self-Contained</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/XBYN7WX3L6QQHGCO6N6KCMAQLUXJMIJX/\">Announced</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Stratis_3.0.0\">Stratis 3.0.0</a></td>\n<td>Self-Contained</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/MVDUEBB26H7KG7KNKDMPMIXM4LY6Y2Q4/\">Announced</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2>Fedora Linux 37</h2>\n<p>The table below lists proposed Changes. See the <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Releases/37/ChangeSet\">ChangeSet page</a> or <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=F37Changes\">Bugzilla</a> for information on approved Changes.</p>\n<table><thead><tr>\n<th>Proposal</th>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th>Status</th>\n</tr></thead></table><h2>Contributing</h2>\n<p>Have something you want included? You can file an issue or submit a pull request in the <a href=\"https://pagure.io/fedora-pgm/pgm_communication\">fedora-pgm/pgm_communication repo</a>.</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 1, "updated_at": "2022-01-02T20:26:32.778Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 10, "reads": 12, "readers_count":